==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|grc|ῥίζα||root}} and {{l|en|-ome}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɹaɪzoʊm/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|botany}} A [[horizontal]], [[underground]] [[stem]] of some [[plant]]s that sends out [[root]]s and [[shoot]]s from its [[node]]s.
# {{lb|en|philosophy}} A so-called "image of thought" that [[apprehend]]s [[multiplicity|multiplicities]]. See {{w|Rhizome (philosophy)}}.

